  "contract": "#988: Spirit of Fire rank 1 (500167) and rank 2 (500644) are family 30 passives whose e1 is aura 317 (SPELL_AURA_ASCENSION_MOD_ABSORB_AMOUNT_PCT) misc 126, BasePoints 19 / 39 = +20% / +40% (e2 does the same for summons and is not asserted). AuraEffect::CalculateAmount (SpellAuraEffects.cpp:630-650) multiplies a SCHOOL_ABSORB amount above zero by that modifier when the caster is a Pyromancer and the spell is family 30, so it is core code, not module code. Volcanic Shell 805477 is family 30 with e1 SPELL_AURA_SCHOOL_ABSORB (69) BasePoints 624, Fire (misc 127, inside mask 126). Asserts the shield's aura amount, measured by casting it before and after learning each rank, is 1.20x at rank 1 and 1.40x at rank 2 (ratio bounds absorb rounding).",
